  {type:'standard',p:'Which rules work for 5,600?',c:['2, 4, 5, and 10','2, 5, and 10','All five','4, 5, and 8'],a:2,e:'It meets every rule: 600 is divisible by 8 and 00 meets the other ending rules.'},
